{
    "title": "Plate Lookup",
    "description": "Looking for a used car? Want to learn more about a passing vehicle? Enter a license plate or VIN and quickly get information on model, year, engine, value and more specs. Make car buying easier.\r\n\r\nNEW!\r\n\u2022 View sales history, past recalls and defects.\r\n\u2022 Search by make, model, year and trim.\r\n\r\nQUICK & EASY\r\nUpload an image of a license plate or manually enter in a license plate or VIN. If you don't have a specific car in mind, you can also search by make, model, year and trim.\r\n\r\nOTHER FEATURES:\r\n\u2022 Use license plate to retrieve VIN\r\n\u2022 Free 25 searches\r\n\u2022 Get Vehicle History Report\r\n\u2022 View your past lookups\r\n\u2022 Save reports to your favorites to access again\r\n\r\nSearches limited to U.S. license plates only.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Looking for a used car? Want to learn more about a passing vehicle? Enter a license plate or VIN and quickly get information on model, year, engine, value and more specs. Make car buying easier.<br><br>NEW!<br>\u2022 View sales history, past recalls and defects.<br>\u2022 Search by make, model, year and trim.<br><br>QUICK &amp; EASY<br>Upload an image of a license plate or manually enter in a license plate or VIN. If you don&#39;t have a specific car in mind, you can also search by make, model, year and trim.<br><br>OTHER FEATURES:<br>\u2022 Use license plate to retrieve VIN<br>\u2022 Free 25 searches<br>\u2022 Get Vehicle History Report<br>\u2022 View your past lookups<br>\u2022 Save reports to your favorites to access again<br><br>Searches limited to U.S. license plates only.",
